  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Write four short event sentences. Keep one true effect of the stem cause and three wrong events.",
      "Never use the words cause or effect in a stem or choice.",
      "Tier 1 wrong choices must be far events from home, school, food, pets, play, family, or weather.",
      "Tier 2 wrong choices may share a noun with the stem but must not be what the cause made happen.",
      "Tier 3 wrong choices must be near misses: a restated cause, a reversed pair, an opposite outcome, or a later fact.",
      "Never write two choices that both work as the effect.",
      "Never use a real name. Use <NAME> when a person is named."
    ]
  },
